  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Chop the onion and mince the garlic.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the bottom of a large cazuela over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the tomato paste, cumin, paprika, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Add the green olives and stir to combine.",
    "Cover the cazuela and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Bake for 30 minutes, or until the tagine is hot and the flavors have melded together."
  ],
